        <detaileddescription>
<para>This function accounts for special cases like inserting before a PHI node. The current strategy for inserting before PHI&apos;s is to duplicate the instructions for each predecessor. However, while that&apos;s ok for G_TRUNC on most targets since it generally requires no code, other targets/cases may want to try harder to find a dominating block. </para>
